### Documentation ###
# Everything under docs/ is ignored by default, so local notes and drafts stay
# private. Curated, team-facing documents are added one by one, each with its own
# exception line below, in the same commit as the document itself.
docs/*
!docs/README.md
!docs/architecture.md
!docs/roles-and-permissions.md
!docs/factories.md
!docs/testing.md
!docs/deployments.md
!docs/vaults.md
!docs/fuse-catalog.md
!docs/invariants.md
!docs/troubleshooting.md
!docs/ci.md
!docs/release.md
!docs/mcp.md
!docs/recipes/
!docs/recipes/*.md
